wwal (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of wwal 1.0.0:
    - Direct DMA-BUF scanout with non-linear modifier and 10-bit HDR support.
    - 18 GLES 3.1 compute shader transitions and AVX-512/AVX2/NEON SIMD kernels.
    - Zero-FFmpeg MP4/WebM demuxer and H.264/HEVC/VP9/AV1 VA-API video playback.
    - Live Shadertoy fragment/compute engine with PipeWire 64-bin Bark FFT.
    - Sub-ms OKLab/CAM16/HCT Material Design 3 palette extraction and caelestia sync.
    - Drop-in swww/awww CLI compatibility and systemd socket activation.

